{
  "goal": "Record the UPDATE MEMBER INFORMATION capability against MERIDIAN CORE. (1) Sign on. (2) Member Inquiry -> search by Member Number for the memberId parameter -> Select. (3) Click 'Update Member Information'. (4) Type the email parameter into the E-mail field, the phone parameter into Phone, and the address parameter into Mailing Address. (5) Click 'Save Changes' - this modifies the member record, so mark it irreversible=true (a human pre-authorised this recording). (6) On the confirmation screen use read ONCE to capture the confirmation line into an output named 'confirmation' - target the value cell next to its label, and do NOT target the member's name, e-mail, phone or address. (7) Do NOT declare_outcome for the success case: success is already expressed by the step's own checkpoint, and a terminal outcome that fires on the success screen would be dead weight. Only declare_outcome if you deliberately probe a FAILURE state. (8) declare_done with capability_id 'member.updateInfo'.",
